# Only explicitly reviewed source files are tracked.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Start-Airplay.ps1
!requirements-windows.txt
!tests/
!tests/test_*.py
!patches/
!patches/*.patch
!research/
!research/*.md
!tools/
!tools/ptp_probe.py
!.gitattributes
!docs/
!docs/*.md

# Private and generated material stays ignored even inside source folders.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
